quiz.prompt:
A program has these three event blocks:

```
card.onButton("A", "press", () => { screen.showNumber(1); });
card.onButton("B", "press", () => { screen.showNumber(2); });
card.onButton("AB", "press", () => { screen.showNumber(3); });
```

You press the A+B button underneath the virtual card. What is shown on the screen?

Ceylin wants a happy face when she presses A and a sad face when she presses B. But nothing happens when she presses B, and when she presses A she sees a sad face instead of a happy one. Her code:

```
card.onButton("A", "press", () => { screen.showIcon("happy"); });
card.onButton("A", "press", () => { screen.showIcon("sad"); });
```

What is the bug?
